# Tonics (world expansion 1, K3): bought in the village, one at a time (`group: tonic`), for a month. While one holds,
# the plain checks its `boost:` names come one rung easier (`@balance tonic`). Fights and negotiations never read it.

@state courage_blend
name: Courage Blend
kind: buff
group: tonic
duration: 1
art: cup
boost: appeal perform
desc: Mabel's courage blend: ginger, honey and something she won't name. Asking for things and getting up in front of people come a little easier.

@state calm_blend
name: Calm Blend
kind: buff
group: tonic
duration: 1
art: cup
boost: exam soothe
desc: Chamomile, lavender and a pinch of moonwort, in a tin Mabel labelled "for nerves". Exam halls and frightened animals both seem quieter.

@state steadying_draught
name: Steadying Draught
kind: buff
group: tonic
duration: 1
art: bottle
boost: research brew enchant
desc: Pell's steadying draught, measured to the drop. Your hands stop shaking over the fine work, and your eyes stop skipping lines.
